    {
      "topic": "advising",
      "text": "Students should consult the department advisor about completing the Upper Division Writing Requirement consistently with university General Education requirements. Students completing the Stony Brook Curriculum must complete a WRTD-satisfying course; the Upper Division Writing Requirement is consistent in most cases with WRTD outcomes."
    },
    {
      "topic": "other",
      "text": "HIS 447, HIS 487, HIS 488, HIS 495, and HIS 496 may not be used to satisfy major or minor requirements. These are excluded from Requirement D."
