    {
      "topic": "other",
      "text": "Thematic clusters: Arts, Ideas & Culture; Empires, Violence & Global Connections; Health, Science & Environmental Change; Law, Politics & Social Justice; Race, Religion, Gender & Sexualities. The thematic cluster is modeled as a choice of one cluster."
    },
    {
      "topic": "grading",
